Annotate an actor method.

.. code-block:: python

    @ray.remote
    class Foo:
        @ray.method(num_returns=2)
        def bar(self):
            return 1, 2

    f = Foo.remote()

    _, _ = f.bar.remote()

Args:
    num_returns: The number of object refs that should be returned by
        invocations of this actor method.

